Description: Align Vibe cues with speech and feed the same words to the Speech Editor
 Export the audio for speech in the existing Kdenlive renderer process and stop
 the export after a bounded interval without audio. Import Vibe word timing
 into the timeline and the existing Speech Editor edit model.
